:TEST-ID tests.interaction.interaction_cffi_layout_map_payload
:TEST-CONTEXT monadc.context.language.feature-interactions
:TEST-PURPOSE C include, layout constructor, field access, and map payload parse together.
:TEST-EXPECT parse-json
:TEST-MENU interaction
:TEST-MENU-PATH reader/interaction
